text No, that's tomorrow, idiot.
text I play the straight man in my one-man show.
text It's really sunny outside.
text All the usual hangouts will be crowded.
text Where should we go?
text I'm sure she'll be making a huge lunch...
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, it's tomorrow, idiot.
text I close my eyes and try to go back to sleep.
