text I throw the blanket off.
text It sucks to sit around when it's so sunny outside.
text I look at the clock and see that there's 24 hours left until my date with Kotomi.
text @[Tomoya]
text Geez, just stop thinking about it.
text I shouldn't have played it cool and just set it for today.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text I should go wander around.
