text I walk around town as usual.
text The sunshine is harsh and I work up a sweat. I can almost hear the sounds of summer creeping in.
text At a crowded fast food joint, I eat a quick lunch.
text I kill some time over a cup of coffee.
text Next to this busy store is a bookstore.
text I can't help but go look for the person with the familiar hair decoration.
text The first day of the long weekend ends uneventfully.
text I can't believe that I'm the same person who once preferred to be alone.
