text Dusk.
text With no destination in mind, I wander all the way here.
text Naturally, no one is around.
text @[Tomoya]
text What am I doing...?
text I have no right to make fun of Kotomi.
text Darkness is setting in.
text As the sun inches closer to the mountains, I can feel the wind getting colder.
text I stay a while, loitering on the street.
text I'm looking forward to going out with Kotomi, and I'm happy that she asked me out.
text But there's something I can't get out of my head.
text Sometimes it comes to me out of nowhere when I'm alone.
text If I had to describe it, I'd say it's a faint sort of regret.
text The wind gusts.
text This is a path I'm not familiar with, the path Kotomi takes by herself.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s8
fi
