	goto s10
fi
goto 17
label s10
text @[Tomoya]
text Excuse me...
text I don't know why I decide to talk to him.
text The gentleman takes a long, hard look at me. Then he looks surprised.
sound D9U.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text @I saw you the other day with...
delay 127
text Kotomi-kun...
text It seems like he hesitates to say her name.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes.
text I answer him tentatively.
text @[Tomoya]
text Kotomi is probably at home.
sound D9V.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text No...
sound D9W.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text I can't bring myself to go any further.
text I look at his appearance again.
text He's wearing a navy blue suit with a light coat and frameless glasses.
text It doesn't seem like he works in an office. There's an air of rigidity about him, but he doesn't appear to be a bad person.
sound D9X.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text By the way, I haven't introduced myself yet.
text Possibly because he senses my cautiousness, he says that with a wry smile.
sound D9Y.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text I am... simply put, a colleague of her parents.
sound D9Z.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Do you know about the Ichinoses?
text I heard from the bread lady that her parents are great scholars.
text That's all I know about Kotomi's family background.
text @[Tomoya]
text I heard that they're great scholars.
sound DA0.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Yes. The Ichinoses were scientists deserving of that description.
sound DA1.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Bear with me for a moment. The dimensions we can perceive do not constitute the universe in its entirety.
sound DA2.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text In the processes that shape this world, certain portions have fallen away. The dimensions sealed away in minute particles form the so-called "hidden world."
sound DA3.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text And those two were the first to make this discovery.
sound DA4.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Or should I say, they would have made the discovery.
text He's making less sense than Kotomi.
text He's probably talking about a world I would never have to deal with in my lifetime.
text The gentleman finally notices that I'm not responding to his explanation.
sound DA5.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Oh, excuse me.
sound DA6.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text In short, being able to assist in the Ichinoses' research was the pride and joy of my life.
sound DA7.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text But to her, we were and still are the "bad guys."
text His earlier wry smile is now a sad one.
sound DA8.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text By the way, are you also waiting for Kotomi-kun?
text @[Tomoya]
text No...
text I'm about to answer him, but I notice his playful demeanor.
text @[Tomoya]
text Did I look like I was?
sound DA9.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text You looked as if you were on your way home without meeting the person you wanted to see.
text He asks that as if seeing right through me.
sound DAA.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Are you her lover?
choice She's just a friend|Not yet...
setvar intF[1089] = selected
sound 02.aac
setvar intF[1089] - 1
if intF[1089] == 1
	goto s11
fi
goto 15
label s11
text @[Tomoya]
text Not...
text I almost keep going, but Kotomi's face comes to mind and I pause.
text She's like a small child, but she always looks so serious about everything.
text I think about how great it'd be if I were closer with her.
text Even if she's standing at the edge of a vast, unknown darkness...
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm not right now, but I would like to be in the future.
sound DAB.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text I see. That's a good answer.
text The gentleman smiles at me, amused.
text He leisurely leans against the wall and glances up.
sound DAC.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text She's the daughter of two of the world's greatest theoretical physicists.
sound DAD.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text She inherited the tenacity and high-mindedness of her father and the discerning observation and photographic memory of her mother.
sound DAE.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text The Ichinoses said they wanted to raise their child in this town, with all of its fresh air.
sound DAF.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text More than anything, this was their hometown. It may lack convenience, but the professor was adamant about commuting to the lab from here.
sound DAG.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text In the end, that would prove to be their downfall...
music ~
text His words trail off and he squints as he looks into the distant sunset.
