music BGM16B.mp3
sound DAH.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text On that day, tiny coincidences added up to a great tragedy.
sound DAI.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text The maid of the Ichinose household suddenly fell ill, and her replacement did not work out well.
sound DAJ.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Because the telephone didn't work, they couldn't even locate her.
sound DAK.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text We were all confused and in a panic.
sound DAL.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text We believed that there were more important things to tend to.
sound DAM.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Everyone assumed someone else was by her side.
sound DAN.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Those are nothing but worthless excuses.
text The gentleman isn't even talking to me anymore.
text He doesn't appear to be talking to anyone in particular.
text He wants to confess and wait for the day he can be forgiven. That's what he sounds like.
sound DAO.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text We paid a high price for our mistakes.
sound DAP.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text When somebody should have been by her side...
sound DAQ.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text When it was absolutely critical...
sound DAR.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text She was left all alone.
text His words trail off.
text I can't say anything, nor do I want to.
text Kotomi refuses to talk about her family and her childhood.
text I get the feeling that it's a topic I shouldn't pry into.
setvar strS[1000] = "KURO"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
