text The gentleman steps away from the wall and turns to me.
sound DAS.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text What do you think about her?
text I already have an answer.
text @[Tomoya]
text Kotomi may be... strange. But she's a normal girl.
text @[Tomoya]
text I want to always be with her.
text The gentleman nods approvingly.
sound DAT.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Tell me one last thing.
sound DAU.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Does she still carry around a pair of scissors?
text @[Tomoya]
text Scissors...
text I remember that when Kotomi cuts up the pages of a book, it always seems like she's wishing for something.
text @[Tomoya]
text She does.
text I don't know why he asked, but I answer him anyway.
goto 16
label 15
if intF[1089] == 0
	goto s16
fi
goto 16
label s16
text @[Tomoya]
text She's just a friend.
text I answer him.
text It's probably also because I don't know the meaning behind his question.
text It's true that I care about Kotomi.
text But... Kotomi has this aura where she refuses to take that final step.
text Even now, something about that bothers me in the back of my mind.
setvar intF[413] = 1
label 16
sound DAV.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text I see...
text The gentleman nods.
sound DAW.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text If you see her, please convey a message for me.
sound DAX.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text I don't expect forgiveness, but...
sound DAY.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text We still regret what we did that day.
text He says it slowly, as if reflecting on it.
sound DAZ.aac
text @[Gentleman]
text Thank you for listening to me. Goodbye.
text Before I can ask him anything in return, the gentleman walks away.
text He walks quickly around the corner toward the bus route.
goto 18
